+     * constant compared to 4 cycles for LDR), it fights for bandwidth with
+     * the arithmetic instructions.
+     *
+     *   I   L   S
+     * MOVK
+     * MOVK
+     * MOVK
+     * MOVK
+     * ADD
+     * SUB      STR
+     *          STR
